      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "«entrypoint/cli»\nProgram\n────────────────────────────────────────\n- creator runnerCreator (inbound.RunnerCreator)\n- out, errOut io.Writer\n+ NewProgram(creator) *Program\n+ Run(args []string) error   (no cobra — hand-rolled)\n- flagSplitter: splits patterns from flags\n  (--, inline =value, separate-token values)\n- buildConfig(patterns, flagArgs) (config.Config, error)\nArgumentError: wraps a usage error -> exit code 2",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 220,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "«entrypoint/cli»\nProgram\n────────────────────────────────────────\n- creator runnerCreator (inbound.RunnerCreator)\n- out, errOut io.Writer\n+ NewProgram(creator) *Program\n+ Run(args []string) error   (no cobra — hand-rolled)\n- flagSplitter: splits patterns from flags\n  (--, inline =value, separate-token values)\n- buildConfig(patterns, flagArgs) (config.Config, error)\nArgumentError: wraps a usage error -> exit code 2",
      "lineHeight": 1.5
    },
