      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 140,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "«application/runner.go»\nRunner\n──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n- processSvc *process.Service  · gameSvc *game.Service\n- scoreSvc   *score.Service\n+ NewRunner(processSvc, scoreSvc, gameSvc) *Runner\n+ Run(cfg config.Config) error   implements inbound.Runner\n(built by internal/composition.RunnerCreator; errors classified via application/apperror)",
