      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "«core/game»  Session · Target · Input · timer · confirmation · roster\n──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nSession: -cfg Config -state lifecycle -timer timer -confirm confirmation\n         -throttle *movement.Throttle -roster roster -bounds movement.Bounds\n         +NewSession(processes,cfg) +Start(w,h) +Update(w,h) +IsRunning() +Stop()\n         +StartTime() +Throttle() +Targets() +AvailableTargets()\n         +TimeLimit() +PendingConfirm() +RequestConfirm(t)\nTarget: Info process.Info · Motion movement.Motion  (named fields, not embedded)\n        State State (Alive/Killing/Fleeing/Dead) · AnimationTick int\n        +NewTarget() +Tag() +Update() +Kill() +Reap() +AnimationProgress()\n        -isAlive() -isDead() -isHitAt(x,y) -move()\nInput: -s *Session  +NewInput(s) *Input\n       +OnQuit() +OnYes() *Target +OnNo() +OnSpeedUp() +OnSpeedDown()\n       +OnClickAt(x,y) *Target\ntimer: clock injected as func() time.Time — no lazy default\nlifecycle (pending/running/stopped): plain int32 field, no sync/atomic",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 280,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "«core/game»  Session · Target · Input · timer · confirmation · roster\n──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nSession: -cfg Config -state lifecycle -timer timer -confirm confirmation\n         -throttle *movement.Throttle -roster roster -bounds movement.Bounds\n         +NewSession(processes,cfg) +Start(w,h) +Update(w,h) +IsRunning() +Stop()\n         +StartTime() +Throttle() +Targets() +AvailableTargets()\n         +TimeLimit() +PendingConfirm() +RequestConfirm(t)\nTarget: Info process.Info · Motion movement.Motion  (named fields, not embedded)\n        State State (Alive/Killing/Fleeing/Dead) · AnimationTick int\n        +NewTarget() +Tag() +Update() +Kill() +Reap() +AnimationProgress()\n        -isAlive() -isDead() -isHitAt(x,y) -move()\nInput: -s *Session  +NewInput(s) *Input\n       +OnQuit() +OnYes() *Target +OnNo() +OnSpeedUp() +OnSpeedDown()\n       +OnClickAt(x,y) *Target\ntimer: clock injected as func() time.Time — no lazy default\nlifecycle (pending/running/stopped): plain int32 field, no sync/atomic",
      "lineHeight": 1.5
    },
